<title>USA: MIDCOM Communications issues notes.</title>
<headline>MIDCOM Communications issues notes.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MIDCOM Communications Inc said Friday it has closed the private placement of just over $12.7 million of convertible subordinated notes, issued due to an over-allotment option for its recent sale of $85 million of convertible subordinated notes.</p>
<p>The notes bear interest at the rate of 8-1/4 percent and the principal amount of the notes due August 15, 2003, may be converted, at the option of the holders, into shares of MIDCOM common stock at a conversion price of $14.0875 per share.</p>
</text>
